title: Context Menu
description: A menu that appears at the pointer on right click or long press.

links:
  doc: https://shardsui.com/svelte/context-menu
---

<ComponentPreview name="p-context-menu-1" />

## Installation

<InstallCommand
  pnpm="pnpm add @coss-sv/ui"
  shadcnSvelte="pnpm dlx shadcn-svelte@latest add https://coss-sv.vercel.app/r/context-menu.json"
/>

## Usage

```svelte
<script lang="ts">
  import * as ContextMenu from "@coss-sv/ui/components/ui/context-menu";
</script>

<ContextMenu.Root>
  <ContextMenu.Trigger>Right click here</ContextMenu.Trigger>
  <ContextMenu.Popup>
    <ContextMenu.Item>Back</ContextMenu.Item>
    <ContextMenu.Item>Forward</ContextMenu.Item>
  </ContextMenu.Popup>
</ContextMenu.Root>
```

## API Reference

### ContextMenu.Root

Manages a context menu.

### ContextMenu.Trigger

The region that responds to right click or long press.

### ContextMenu.Popup

Positions menu content at the pointer.

### ContextMenu.Group

Groups related items.

### ContextMenu.Item

An individual action.

### ContextMenu.LinkItem

A native anchor styled as a context-menu item.

### ContextMenu.CheckboxItem

A checkable item with an optional switch appearance.

### ContextMenu.RadioGroup

Groups radio items.

### ContextMenu.RadioItem

A radio item.

### ContextMenu.GroupLabel

Labels a group.

### ContextMenu.Separator

Separates sections.

### ContextMenu.Shortcut

Displays keyboard shortcut text.

### ContextMenu.Sub

Manages a submenu.

### ContextMenu.SubTrigger

Opens a submenu.

### ContextMenu.SubPopup

Contains submenu items.

